  "body": "Part of #4023. Builds on K0.\n\n## What to do\n\nMake one test suite that checks each 2D milling strategy against the laws of #4023.\n\n- The same region and the same guide choice give the same curves.\n- The start side changes only the order and the start point.\n- Each lift has a named reason.\n- Each fallback is visible.\n- No entry into material occurs without a proof.\n- No cut above the engagement limit occurs without a name.\n\nAdd the suite to an existing directory suite. Add each strategy when it moves to the kernel.\n\n## Done means\n\nThe suite covers each 2D milling strategy and is green.\n",
